cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Teaching an RL Agent to Play 3D Pinball Space Cadet"
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Adriano
    family-names: Pires Cunha
    alias: driano1221
repository-code: "https://github.com/driano1221/space-cadet-rl"
url: "https://driano1221.github.io/space-cadet-rl/"
abstract: >-
  A reinforcement learning agent trained on the original 3D Pinball Space Cadet
  engine, instrumented in C++ rather than screen-scraped. The agent reaches 4.3x
  a random policy, but drops to 0.62x once its actions carry 250 ms of latency,
  showing its advantage is high-frequency reactive control rather than strategy.
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning
  - ppo
  - game-ai
  - reverse-engineering
